1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
In microgravity, identical flame lengths
can hide different spread rates.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Saffire shows four-centimeter flames spreading
at 0.18 versus 0.21 centimeters per second.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:16,000
We audited NASA experiments, accounting for
oxygen, airflow, geometry, and confounding.

4
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:22,000
Our system combines physics, machine-learning baselines,
and synthetically verified interaction analysis.

5
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:29,000
1gnition shows the evidence, flags unsupported
predictions, and identifies the missing experiment.
